  "knowledgeBase": {
    "content": "Lumen Yoga is a boutique yoga studio in Cais do Sodré, Lisbon, founded in 2022 by Marta Silva. 2 rooms, max 14 students per class, 6 teachers. Classes: Vinyasa, Yin, Hatha, Sunrise Flow (Sat 7:00), Beginners Foundations (Tue/Thu 19:00), and a new Mat Pilates class starting in November 2026. Classes are taught in English and Portuguese. Booking is through the website (Momence). Current members: about 180 active. Biggest problem: new students try one class and do not come back; first-month retention is about 35%. Summer (July-August) is the slow season because locals leave and tourists only drop in. Google rating 4.8 from 212 reviews. Instagram @lumenyoga.lx has about 4,100 followers. The studio is closed from December 24 to January 2.",
    "truncated": false
  },
